@Todo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5167
@listId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@taskId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Register
# @name register
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@local.test",
  "password": "TestPass1",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@local.test",
  "password": "TestPass1"
}

### Refresh access token (uses httpOnly refresh cookie from login)
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh

### Logout (clears refresh cookie)
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

### Get current user
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get all lists (current user)
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get list by id
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create list
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My List",
  "color": "#3b82f6"
}

### Get tasks for a list
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create task
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk",
  "description": "From the store",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": null
}

### Update task status
PATCH {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": 2
}

### Delete task
DELETE {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

@workspaceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
@inviteToken = paste-token-from-send-invite-response

### Get my workspaces
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create shared workspace
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Family"
}

### Send workspace invite (Owner only; returns token for dev/testing)
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "partner@example.com",
  "role": 1
}

### List pending invites for workspace
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Accept invite (invitee must be logged in with matching email)
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invites/{{inviteToken}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Decline invite
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invites/{{inviteToken}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
